  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="MPK">
<l>tirumaḻai  talaiiya  viruḷniṟa  vicumpiṉ</l>
<l>viṇṇati rimiḻicai kaṭuppap  paṇṇamaittut</l>
<l>tiṇvār  vicitta  muḻavo ṭākuḷi</l>
<l>nuṇṇuruk kuṟṟa viḷaṅkaṭarp pāṇṭil</l>
<l>miṉṉirum  pīli yaṇitaḻaik kōṭṭoṭu</l>
<l>kaṇṇiṭai viṭutta  kaḷiṟṟuyirt tūmpi</l>
<l>ṉiḷippayi rimiruṅ kuṟumparan tūmpoṭu</l>
<l>viḷippatu kavarun tīṅkuḻa ṟutaii</l>
<l>naṭuvuniṉ ṟicaikku marikkural taṭṭai</l>
<l>kaṭikavar polikkum valvā yellari</l>
      </lg>
